---
title: "getMemberDisplayName (stem-system members.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_env: apiUrl = env.STEM_BOT_API_URL, token = env.BEARER_TOKEN
    q_env --> q_check: apiUrl and token and discordUid all present?
    q_check --> q_null_early: missing any required value
    q_null_early --> [*]: return null
    q_check --> q_fetch: all present
    q_fetch --> q_get: fetch GET /api/nickname?discord_uid=...
    q_get --> q_check_res: response received
    q_check_res --> q_error_res: !response.ok
    q_error_res --> [*]: return null
    q_check_res --> q_parse: response.ok
    q_parse --> q_return: data = response.json()
    q_return --> [*]: return data.name_only or null
    q_get --> q_catch: fetch throws exception
    q_catch --> [*]: return null

    note right of q_check
        INV-001: Returns null for any missing configuration or Discord UID
    end note

    note right of q_return
        INV-002: Only the name_only field from API response is used
    end note
